{"id":"622077","name":"凉拌花瓜腐竹","author":"还在吃吃吃","authorId":"10106890","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/622077/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"2根"},{"name":"腐竹","amount":"20克"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"葱蒜末和小米椒圈","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"香醋","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备黄瓜2根，清洗干净后用刀拍碎。","img":"images/622077/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"腐竹用温水泡发。","img":"images/622077/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"黄瓜拍碎后装盘。","img":"images/622077/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"腐竹烧水焯烫。","img":"images/622077/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"准备葱蒜末和小米椒圈。","img":"images/622077/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"焯烫好的腐竹也装入盘中。","img":"images/622077/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入葱蒜末和小米椒圈，加入食盐淋上热油。","img":"images/622077/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入生抽。","img":"images/622077/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入香醋。","img":"images/622077/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搅拌均匀","img":"images/622077/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}